  "description": "The Horizon Tour 10 Wave offers low-maintenance, everyday riding with a low step-through frame for easy mounting and convenience. LED lighting enhances visibility on busy city routes, and the Racktime carrier with KID'n'CARRY and SNAPIT 2.0 compatibility supports bags, baskets or a child seat.\n\nIts belt-drive with internal gear hub delivers quiet, reliable shifting without the maintenance of a chain. The adjustable stem supports a relaxed riding posture, and SP Connect makes it easy to attach your smartphone for everyday riding and navigation. Full fenders and a 100mm suspension fork help smooth out rougher paths during longer rides. Schwalbe Energizer Plus tires provide reliable puncture protection and confident grip for urban and suburban terrain.\n\nWith strong support from the Bosch Performance Line PX motor and a 720Wh PowerTube battery, compatibility with the Bosch PowerMore battery and connectivity functions via the Bosch eBike Flow App, it's ready for extended trips and daily commutes.",
